You are assisting with business process modelling.

SENTENCES
- Some customers contact the company a few days after delivery only because they no longer want the items, without reporting any issue

STATEMENT
its customer has withdrawn from the contract

Do these sentences, on their own and taken together, state that the statement is true? Answer yes or no with one line of reason.
Answer with one JSON object that follows the JSON schema below. Output only the JSON, with no other text.

JSON SCHEMA
{
  "properties": {
    "answer": {
      "description": "yes if the sentence on its own states it, otherwise no",
      "enum": [
        "yes",
        "no"
      ],
      "title": "Answer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "reason": {
      "description": "One line of reason",
      "title": "Reason",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "answer",
    "reason"
  ],
  "title": "VerifierOutputV2",
  "type": "object"
}

message.content:
{
  "answer": "no",
  "reason": "The sentence describes a customer's motivation for contacting the company (change of mind) but does not explicitly state that the contract has been formally withdrawn."
}
